 *   NETLLBUF  = IPBUF(0) - NET_LL_HDRLEN      netdev.h:207
 *
 * The previous code did iob_reserve() + iob_trycopyin(offset 0) by hand, which
 * put the whole frame after the reserve area and left IOB_DATA on the Ethernet
